fort in his bed last night.

00:01:28.258 --> 00:01:32.554
And before I left, like, the
couch had been taken apart with

00:01:32.554 --> 00:01:36.249
every type of pillow,
sheet, they like just go.

00:01:36.249 --> 00:01:37.082
- Cushions are all over the floor.

00:01:37.082 --> 00:01:37.915
- All over the floor.

00:01:37.915 --> 00:01:38.841
- Like thanks, cause that's super clean.

